    Comprehensive and Challenging (Tang et al., ACL 2025).
    See benchmarks/FinanceReasoning/NOTICE.

benchmarks/MMLU-Pro/
    MMLU-Pro: A More Robust and Challenging Multi-Task Language Understanding
    Benchmark (Wang et al., NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks).
    Licensed under the MIT License; see benchmarks/MMLU-Pro/LICENSE.
    See benchmarks/MMLU-Pro/NOTICE.

benchmarks/FinTrust/
    FinTrust: A Comprehensive Benchmark of Trustworthiness Evaluation in Finance
    Domain (Hu et al., EMNLP 2025).
    See benchmarks/FinTrust/NOTICE.

contrib/big-finance-benchmark/
    Big Finance Harness, Rogo Technologies. Licensed under the Apache License,
